  "description": "An outbuilding in the garden to be used as a non habitable space. The building will be positioned towards the rear boundary of the garden, maintaining appropriate separation distances from the dwelling and neighbouring boundaries, as shown on the accompanying block plan and elevation drawings. No alterations are proposed to the existing vehicular or pedestrian access to the property from Wickham Road. No new streets, driveways, or means of enclosure are proposed as part of this application. A small area of hardstanding will be provided immediately adjacent to the front of the outbuilding to facilitate level access; this will consist of permeable paving or similar material to allow for natural surface water drainage. All surface water from the building’s roof will be directed to a suitable soakaway or water butt within the rear garden area to ensure on-site drainage and prevent surface run-off.",
